+| OTD 90, QTY_ACC 90, INV_MATCH 90 (QUAL_ACC absent) | 90.00, **LOW** |
+| OTD 90, QTY_ACC 80, INV_MATCH 71 (QUAL_ACC absent) | 6025/75 = 80.3333… → 80.33, MEDIUM (band: 6025 ≥ 75 × 75 = 5625 and < 90 × 75 = 6750) |
